.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt X509_STORE_CTX_GET_BY_SUBJECT 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm X509_STORE_CTX_get_by_subject ,
.Nm X509_STORE_CTX_get_obj_by_subject
.Nd X509 and X509_CRL lookup functions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/x509_vfy.h
.Ft int
.Fo X509_STORE_CTX_get_by_subject
.Fa "const X509_STORE_CTX *vs"
.Fa "X509_LOOKUP_TYPE type"
.Fa "const X509_NAME *name"
.Fa "X509_OBJECT *ret"
.Fc
.Ft X509_OBJECT *
.Fo X509_STORE_CTX_get_obj_by_subject
.Fa "X509_STORE_CTX *vs"
.Fa "X509_LOOKUP_TYPE type"
.Fa "const X509_NAME *name"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_get_by_subject
tries to find an object of given
.Fa type ,
which may be
.Sy X509_LU_X509
or
.Sy X509_LU_CRL ,
and subject
.Fa name
from the store in the provided store context
.Fa vs .
If found and
.Fa ret
is not NULL, it increments the reference count and stores the looked up
object in
.Fa ret .
.Pp
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_get_obj_by_subject
is like
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_get_by_subject
but returns the found object on success, else NULL.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_get_by_subject
returns 1 if the lookup was successful, else 0.
.Pp
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_get_obj_by_subject
returns an object on success, else NULL.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr X509_LOOKUP_meth_set_get_by_subject 3 ,
.Xr X509_LOOKUP_by_subject 3
